  "summaryParagraphs": [
    "This PR introduces a structured compliance policy workflow for AI-assisted SDLC work. It adds dedicated compliance policy agents for analysis, planning, test review, and verification; a command entrypoint; a Cursor rule that routes policy changes into the workflow; and a new skill with detailed references for policy patterns, workflow steps, PR summaries, traceability, and test review rules.",
    "It also strengthens OPA coding guidance and adds GitHub CI enforcement scripts for compliance policy pairing, changed-test extraction, and linting. The shape is heavily documentation and workflow oriented, with a small amount of JavaScript automation and one workflow file to make the guidance enforceable in CI."
  ],
